  "headline": "Atenolol is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 6.4 days on hand and the best option is to transfer 35 tablets from Corvale Lakeside",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include atenolol as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 105 tablets of atenolol 25 mg with a daily use of 16.5, giving 6.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 80 tablets of atenolol 25 mg with a daily use of 3.2, giving 25.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option by rule is to transfer 35 tablets of 25 mg from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with two weeks of supply and raise East to 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites use product labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack (NDC 71335-1535-1).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bryant Ranch Prepack's plant (FEI 1000519407) was last inspected on 2026-07-16 and classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E15"]
    }
  ]
}
